{
  "sequence_id": "seq_b9b5a9ad9a64ced9",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "[...]we came"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What was that sound..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "only an idiot wouldn't know that..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's the sound of a drum."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A festival ...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hey, did you two really not mate last night?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Denji's surprisingly gentlemanly!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "MANGA STREAN do not mirror"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You're sure wolfing down the Ramen here..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Doesn't it taste awful?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The A.A.A. 100, 650, 650, 650, 650, 650, 650,000,000,000,000,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It tastes pretty good to me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Don't talk like you know me!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You just don't know good flavors from bad."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Well, not like you can help it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Apparently if you only eat the same sorts of things when you're a kid, it dulls your sense of taste once you become an adult."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Megan"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And if you lose your sense of taste, then your overall happiness decreases."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "??"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But I am happy!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "shall we leave?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "??"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "My old man was the nicest guy in the world."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "He took me to all sorts of expensive places and let me try good food."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "He was a Yakuza, but he was a just Yakuza."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You could say people like him were a necessary evil..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You could count on one hand the number of girls he ever killed,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And he'd take the money from selling drugs and buy you anything you wanted..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "WONING A SHREANLOM TO NOT MARROR"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Everyone loved him. He was a good man, a real edo man, through and through..."
    }
  ],
